    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと&lt;Kyle&gt;！
そんなにたくさん持って行っちゃ
ダメでしょ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, Kyle!
You can't take
that many with you!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>大きな肉が、火であぶられている････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A large piece of meat is being fried in the fire...</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>これは食用の花のようだ
宿屋の料理で使うのだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>These appear to be edible flowers,
to be used in the innkeeper's cooking.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>食用花をそれとなく食べてみた
さすがに生ではまずかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I tried to eat the edible flowers
without thinking about it, but
they were indeed not good raw.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おっ!?
そこに居るのは
つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;じゃないか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa!
It's Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;,
in the flesh!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>よう、ネルソン！久しぶりだな！
相変わらずジョーと一緒に
スカートめくりやってんのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, Nelson! Long time no see!
Are you still flipping skirts with Joe?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ハハハ！　俺はもう所帯持ちだからな
いつまでも遊んでられないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha ha ha!　I've got a family now,
so I can't keep playing with you.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なっ････
お前、結婚したのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh...
You're a married man now?!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Loni&gt;は、相変わらず
独り身なのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Loni&gt;, are you still single?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ああ！　モテねーんだよ！
ちくしょう！　俺とジョーとお前は
ずっと独り身だと思ってたのに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Agh, I'm not popular, dammit! I thought
me, you, and Joe would be forever alone!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>イヤな想像をしないでくれよ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't get any bad ideas from me...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>昔は俺とジョーと&lt;Loni&gt;で
伝説を作ったもんだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Back in the day, me, Joe, and &lt;Loni&gt;
would make legends of our own.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>だが少年の日々は、もう終わりさ
俺、もうすぐ父親になるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But my boyhood days are over, and
I'm going to be a father soon.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なにっ！
一人だけ良い思いしやがって！
こ、この裏切り者め！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell! You're the only one
living the good life!
You little traitor!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>俺と同い年のヤツが、もうオヤジに
なるなんてな････
複雑な気分だぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't believe you're my age
and already an old man...
It's perplexing.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>まあ、お前には一生、機会がない
ことだろうからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you probably won't have a
chance for the rest of your life.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>俺、もうすぐ父親になるんだよ
早く俺とジョーと&lt;Loni&gt;がつくった
伝説を語り継ぎたくて
ウズウズしてるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm going to be a father soon,
and I'm itching to pass on the
legend that &lt;Loni&gt;, Joe, and I've created.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>スカートめくりの話なんて
語り継がないほうが････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's better not to retell the
story of the skirt-flipping...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;、俺たちの伝説をナメちゃいけない
俺たちの活躍は四英雄に匹敵するほどなんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;, don't underestimate our legends,
our exploits rival those of the Four Heroes.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>よお&lt;Loni&gt;
どっか行くのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yo, Loni,
are you going somewhere?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ああ
運命の出会いってやつを
さがしにな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I'm looking for
a meeting with destiny.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <JapaneseText>運命の出会いー？
止めとけ止めとけ！
お前に見つけられるハズがないって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meeintg with destiny's meeting?
Stop, stop, stop! There's no way
you're gonna find it!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <JapaneseText>つむじ風の&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whirlwind &lt;Loni&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なんか、ヒドい言われようだな････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What an awful thing to say...</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <JapaneseText>俺も、もうすぐ父親だ
時の流れってのは早いもんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm going to be a father, soon
Time just flies.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;、ガキの頃なんて
あっという間に過ぎちまう
今のうちに、せいぜいバカを
やっておきな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;, your childhood will be over
before you know it, so go ahead and
make a fool of yourself while you can.</EnglishText>
